     "id": "s07b",
     "voice": "narrator",
     "start": 5.492,
     "end": 20.926,
     "sub": "At 08:19 it sent one last, partial handshake: most likely the engines running out of fuel and a backup power unit briefly reviving the terminal. An hour later, it did not answer.",
